* Not a single-defect mutant: the plainest textbook design, kept here as a below-1 case.
* Plainest textbook 3-bit flash ADC: resistor ladder (no tap decoupling), seven StrongARM comparators clocked
* straight from clk, a NAND SR latch on each comparator's outputs, thermometer -> one-hot AND gates -> ROM
* (pseudo-NMOS NOR columns with inverters). Rule-of-thumb sizes, minimum device count.

.subckt tb_inv a y vdd vss
MP y a vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=2u l=0.28u
MN y a vss vss nfet_03v3 w=1u l=0.28u
.ends tb_inv

.subckt tb_nand2 a b y vdd vss
MP1 y a vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=2u l=0.28u
MP2 y b vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=2u l=0.28u
MN1 y a nx vss nfet_03v3 w=2u l=0.28u
MN2 nx b vss vss nfet_03v3 w=2u l=0.28u
.ends tb_nand2

.subckt tb_comp clk vinp vinn outp outn vdd vss
* StrongARM: outp/outn precharge high while clk is low; outn falls when vinp > vinn
MTAIL tail clk vss vss nfet_03v3 w=2u l=0.28u
MIN1 dx vinp tail vss nfet_03v3 w=2u l=0.28u
MIN2 dy vinn tail vss nfet_03v3 w=2u l=0.28u
MNL1 outn outp dx vss nfet_03v3 w=1u l=0.28u
MNL2 outp outn dy vss nfet_03v3 w=1u l=0.28u
MPL1 outn outp vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=1u l=0.28u
MPL2 outp outn vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=1u l=0.28u
MPC1 outn clk vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=1u l=0.28u
MPC2 outp clk vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=1u l=0.28u
.ends tb_comp

.subckt tb_latch sb rb q vdd vss
* NAND SR latch, active-low inputs: sb (outn) low sets q, rb (outp) low resets it; both high (precharge) holds
XG1 sb qb q vdd vss tb_nand2
XG2 rb q qb vdd vss tb_nand2
.ends tb_latch

.subckt tb_and a bb y vdd vss
* y = a AND NOT b, given bb = NOT b
XN a bb n vdd vss tb_nand2
XI n y vdd vss tb_inv
.ends tb_and

.subckt flash_adc_3bit vss vdd vrefn vrefp clk vin b2 b1 b0
RL1 t1 vrefn 500
RL2 t2 t1 500
RL3 t3 t2 500
RL4 t4 t3 500
RL5 t5 t4 500
RL6 t6 t5 500
RL7 t7 t6 500
RL8 vrefp t7 500
XC1 clk vin t1 cp1 cn1 vdd vss tb_comp
XC2 clk vin t2 cp2 cn2 vdd vss tb_comp
XC3 clk vin t3 cp3 cn3 vdd vss tb_comp
XC4 clk vin t4 cp4 cn4 vdd vss tb_comp
XC5 clk vin t5 cp5 cn5 vdd vss tb_comp
XC6 clk vin t6 cp6 cn6 vdd vss tb_comp
XC7 clk vin t7 cp7 cn7 vdd vss tb_comp
XL1 cn1 cp1 q1 vdd vss tb_latch
XL2 cn2 cp2 q2 vdd vss tb_latch
XL3 cn3 cp3 q3 vdd vss tb_latch
XL4 cn4 cp4 q4 vdd vss tb_latch
XL5 cn5 cp5 q5 vdd vss tb_latch
XL6 cn6 cp6 q6 vdd vss tb_latch
XL7 cn7 cp7 q7 vdd vss tb_latch
* one-hot h_k = q_k AND NOT q_(k+1); h7 = q7
XI2 q2 nq2 vdd vss tb_inv
XI3 q3 nq3 vdd vss tb_inv
XI4 q4 nq4 vdd vss tb_inv
XI5 q5 nq5 vdd vss tb_inv
XI6 q6 nq6 vdd vss tb_inv
XI7 q7 nq7 vdd vss tb_inv
XH1 q1 nq2 h1 vdd vss tb_and
XH2 q2 nq3 h2 vdd vss tb_and
XH3 q3 nq4 h3 vdd vss tb_and
XH4 q4 nq5 h4 vdd vss tb_and
XH5 q5 nq6 h5 vdd vss tb_and
XH6 q6 nq7 h6 vdd vss tb_and
* ROM: column j is pulled low by every h_k whose code k has bit j set; a weak PMOS load holds it high otherwise
MLD2 c2 vss vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=0.5u l=1u
MLD1 c1 vss vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=0.5u l=1u
MLD0 c0 vss vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=0.5u l=1u
MR24 c2 h4 vss vss nfet_03v3 w=1u l=0.28u
MR25 c2 h5 vss vss nfet_03v3 w=1u l=0.28u
MR26 c2 h6 vss vss nfet_03v3 w=1u l=0.28u
MR27 c2 q7 vss vss nfet_03v3 w=1u l=0.28u
MR12 c1 h2 vss vss nfet_03v3 w=1u l=0.28u
MR13 c1 h3 vss vss nfet_03v3 w=1u l=0.28u
MR16 c1 h6 vss vss nfet_03v3 w=1u l=0.28u
MR17 c1 q7 vss vss nfet_03v3 w=1u l=0.28u
MR01 c0 h1 vss vss nfet_03v3 w=1u l=0.28u
MR03 c0 h3 vss vss nfet_03v3 w=1u l=0.28u
MR05 c0 h5 vss vss nfet_03v3 w=1u l=0.28u
MR07 c0 q7 vss vss nfet_03v3 w=1u l=0.28u
XB2 c2 b2 vdd vss tb_inv
XB1 c1 b1 vdd vss tb_inv
XB0 c0 b0 vdd vss tb_inv
.ends flash_adc_3bit
